      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yoshuani waan worraani jed'e, D'ugaani teesanileeni isanuma, aka isani AABBO Waaqa fohattani isa hojattani worri waan jed'eeni, hataatuti, d'ugaani teennalleeni ha nuuma taatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan jed'eeni, Yoosi Waaqoota gosa d'ibi ka isani qabdani kaani d'id'imati d'aa garaa tokooni AABBO Waaqa Israeliti ufi kenna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba biyyiti waan Yoshuani jette, Nu AABBO Waaqa keenna hojanne dubbi isaa gula yaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Yoshuani wold'aqisa worri Waaqaani wold'aqu worraa tolche, arti fulla Shekemuti aadaafi Seera worraa kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuani dubbi tana kitaaba Seera Waaqa keesati t'aafe d'akha gudda toko fuud'e, fulla woyyuma ta AABBO Waaqa iti kad'attani mukha gudda toko jala old'aabe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan biyya ch'ufaani jed'e, D'akhaani kunini d'uga nuu taha. Inni dubbi AABBO Waaqi nuni jed'e ch'ufa ya d'agaye. Tanaafi inni d'uga isani taha aka isani AABBO Waaqa keesani iti gargaltani imormanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yoshuani biyyaani gala jed'e, nami ch'ufti lafa ufiti gale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duisa Yoshuatifi ka Eleazari",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
