              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 7.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafele Yusufu, ta worri Israeli lafa Misiri keesa d'ufeeni, Shekemuti awaalani, fulla Yakobooni ilmaani Amori abba Shekemu, qarsi d'ibba tokotini iraa bite taani. Fullaani sunini qooda lafa ilmaani Yusufuti kennani keesa jirti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eleazarini ilmi qaallicha Haruni due, Gibea, dira lafa gaareeni ta Efraimu, ka ilma isaa Finehasi kennaniti awaalani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.33",
